From: Iaroslav Voitovych <yaroslav.voytovych@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH BlueZ] adapter: Fix crash on zero-length start discovery reply

start_discovery_complete() validates the reply length before using the
returned parameters:

	if (length < sizeof(*rp)) {
		btd_error(adapter->dev_id,
			"Wrong size of start discovery return parameters");
		discovery_complete(adapter, MGMT_STATUS_FAILED);
		return;
	}

but that check sits below the branch taken when the discovery client list has
emptied while the command was pending, and that branch has already
dereferenced the reply:

	if (!adapter->discovery_list) {
		struct mgmt_cp_stop_discovery cp;

		if (status != MGMT_STATUS_SUCCESS)
			return;

		/* Stop discovering as there are no clients left */
		cp.type = rp->type;      <-- rp may be NULL here

mgmt_cp_start_discovery is a single uint8_t, so rp->type is a one-byte read at
offset 0 and a NULL rp faults immediately.

The mgmt layer can invoke a command callback with no reply parameters --
src/shared/mgmt.c passes length 0 and a NULL param on the Command Status path,
for example. Observed on a QCA9377 (13d3:3503) whose controller stops
answering HCI during audio use: this branch was entered with a success status
and param == NULL, and faulted on the dereference. The crash site was resolved
from the shipped binary:

  bluetoothd[2821]: segfault at 0 ip 00005d6eb1ad1986 sp 00007ffef8e784b0 \
      error 4 in bluetoothd[a6986,5d6eb1a50000+f3000]

  a6986:  41 0f b6 45 00    movzbl 0x0(%r13),%eax     <-- cp.type = rp->type
  a698b:  0f b7 53 04       movzwl 0x4(%rbx),%edx     <-- adapter->dev_id
  a6992:  4c 8d 45 d7       lea    -0x29(%rbp),%r8    <-- &cp

I have not traced which management event produced that combination, and the
fix does not depend on it.

Perform the same length validation before using the reply in the no-clients
branch. The check is added inside that branch rather than hoisted above it, so
that no other path changes behaviour.

Fixes: 3597d1377723 ("adapter: Fix not waiting for start discovery result")
Signed-off-by: Iaroslav Voitovych <yaroslav.voytovych@gmail.com>
---
 src/adapter.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/adapter.c b/src/adapter.c
--- a/src/adapter.c
+++ b/src/adapter.c
@@ -1863,6 +1863,12 @@
 		if (status != MGMT_STATUS_SUCCESS)
 			return;

+		if (length < sizeof(*rp)) {
+			btd_error(adapter->dev_id,
+				"Wrong size of start discovery return parameters");
+			return;
+		}
+
 		/* Stop discovering as there are no clients left */
 		cp.type = rp->type;
 		mgmt_send(adapter->mgmt, MGMT_OP_STOP_DISCOVERY,
--
2.43.0
